      "content": "but \"not participating\" is so vague. what does that even look like? i can't just quit my job and walk away, i'd just be starving. and even then, the pressure to survive just pulls you right back in. it feels like the only way to truly, actually stop the noise and be free of the machine is something much more permanent. something that the system can't undo.",
